/-!
# Enumeration and words of the Fi23 fixed-point loops

The first 695 entries are candidate A loops, followed by 27 candidate B
loops. Neither the counts nor coverage is assumed: `Checks` verifies each path
and proves coverage for every actual fixed letter. Path bits are read from
leaf to root; factor bytes are read in multiplication order.

Source: retained ATLAS F23G1-p31671B0, inverse-cycle convention; GLS3
Table 5.3u and the Fischer paragraph of `refs/KGroup/GLS3/Chapter5(sec3-).tex`.
The untrusted witnesses and their provenance are retained in `Loops/source/`.
-/

